  "Your mail stays yours": "邮件完全由您掌控",
  "Messages are files in your .mail folder. Puter Mail only writes what you ask it to: your copy of a message you send, and the moves behind archive, delete, and restore. Nothing is deleted unless you empty it from Trash.": "所有邮件均为 .mail 目录中的本地文件。邮箱仅执行您请求的操作：保存已发邮件副本，以及执行归档、删除和恢复。除非从废纸篓清空，否则绝不永久删除任何内容。",
